WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,640
This kind of life is really good

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,640
Brother Xiao, what are we doing this afternoon?

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,640
I don't know either

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,640
Just go to the old house market

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,640
Anyone who is doing something there will follow them.

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,640
Oh, okay

7
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,640
Hey, run quickly

8
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,640
If you don't run away, you'll have to be harvested by others.

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,640
It has nothing to do with me

10
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,640
The body and head are covered

11
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
It's under the sun

12
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,640
How can this be?

13
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:18,640
Brother Xiao, stop it

14
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,640
Leave it alone

15
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:20,640
That's not our business

16
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,640
Nothing to do with us

17
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,640
Everyone fainted

18
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,640
Just think of a way to get people aside

19
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,640
so many cars

20
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:28,640
It wouldn't work if they pressed on me, wouldn't it?

21
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,640
Then let me take a video for you

22
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,640
Keep it as evidence

23
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,640
In case you don’t understand clearly later

24
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,340
young man

25
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,340
It was you who saved me, right?

26
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,440
i thank you

27
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,440
Don't worry

28
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,440
I won't starve you

29
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,440
My son is a boss

30
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,440
Neither he nor I can afford to embarrass this person.

31
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,440
no no no

32
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,440
I know you won't starve me

33
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,440
I mean

34
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,440
Please call your family over

35
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:49,490
I'll call dad

36
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:50,490
It's okay, it's okay

37
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,490
I'm much better now

38
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:52,490
This guy saved me

39
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:53,490
Just took me off the road

40
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:54,490
move over here

41
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:55,490
Otherwise I might not know

42
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:56,490
Just let the car run him over.
